abstract: >
  Reproducibility package for AHICF, a generalizable hybrid deep learning
  framework for automated diabetic retinopathy grading and clinical decision
  support. The framework integrates deep visual features, transformer-based
  representations, handcrafted clinical features, multi-objective feature
  optimization, ensemble learning, explainability, cross-dataset validation,
  domain adaptation, calibration, and statistical validation.

